      "text": "FARQ — dev vs prod\nData: RAM vs disk (raft PVC)\nRestart: sab gayab vs safe + auto-unseal\nInit: khud vs ek baar (deploy)\nRoot token: \"root\" vs random (Keychain)\nESO login: root vs Kubernetes auth\nTLS: off vs off (local) / on (prod)\nSeed: har restart vs ek baar",
      "textAlign": "center",
