      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "PROD: asli AWS KMS (local se farq)\nKMS: local-kms pod → AWS managed key\n(koi YAML nahi, key AWS mein ek baar)\nKMS login: dummy keys → Vault pod ka\nIAM role (ServiceAccount, web identity)\nPermissions: sirf kms:Encrypt,\nkms:Decrypt, kms:DescribeKey\nConfig: endpoint + access/secret_key\nhatao, kms_key_id = asli key ARN\nSame: raft, PVC, init once, ESO auth\n⚠ KMS key kabhi delete mat karna",
